          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦Gemini Enterprise: empowers teams to discover, create, share, and run AI agents all in one secure platform, bringing the best of Google AI to employees through an intuitive chat interface, helping to automate workflows and drive smarter business outcomes.",
        "text_hash": "5fa24a66b2be6db64a8ede031cf15240d8b67079e586ce3c341a547152a61b10",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000112-6e57c03e",
